name: EQUIP_SET_NAME_BOSS_ACCESSORY
# Nine slots in GMS: two eye accessories and two earrings among them, plus a
# ring, a pendant, a belt, a shoulderpad and a pocket. Eight of them have an
# item here, so every tier but the last pays -- the belt arrives with the boss
# that drops it.
